	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『境界戦機』から、海老川兼武氏デザインの北米同盟軍のミリタリーテイスト全開の量産型AMAIM(アメイン)ジョーハウンドがHGにラインアップ！",
			"■専用ライフルはマガジンとグレネードが着脱可能。",
			"■頭部シャッターの開閉で駐機状態、表情の変化を再現。",
			"■ハンドパーツは２種付属。武器持ち手は手甲パーツをスライドしナックルモードを再現。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Kyoukai Senki\", the mass-produced AMAIM Jawhound, designed by Kanetake Ebikawa and fully displaying the military taste of the North American Alliance Army, is now available in the HG lineup!",
			"• The special rifle has a detachable magazine and grenade.",
			"• Reproduce the parked state and changes in facial expressions by opening and closing the head shutter.",
			"• Two types of hand parts are included. The weapon holder can be recreated in knuckle mode by sliding the gauntlet parts."
		]
	},
